# Wall-clock ceiling for the pull-request pipeline. R1085-16 item 5.
# scripts/check-ci-wall-clock.rs discovers PR workflows and computes their
# timeout-weighted needs DAG. measured_minutes is that static maximum,
# excluding push-only and dispatch-only jobs; it is not observed runtime.
#
# Historical discovery before the release-first PR ladder deferral (2026-10-09):
#   release.yml: 115 min
#     detect-changes(5m)->macos-core-tests(reusable85m)->build(20m)->pipeline-status(5m)
#   issue-1028-agent-ladder.yml: 120 min
#     plan(30m)->ladder(30m)->leaf-evidence(15m)->composites(30m)->compare(15m)
#
# Both complete cold all-mode runs at source4a560cdb5a47dd3d175ca16adf6d521619437a4e
# ran all63 nodes with compilation enabled. Each included50 full jobs and
# every job/step finished below30 minutes: maxima1110s disabled and1024s enabled.
# Each semantic verdict remains25PASS/38FAIL; timing does not certify task success.
# Their raw100-job/step observations are preserved in the coordinator evidence.
ci_wall_clock pull_request_pipeline
  measured_minutes 115
  measured_date "2026-10-12"
  ceiling_minutes 225
  workflow ".github/workflows/release.yml"
  chain "base(->reusable:pin-base-commit.yml:5m)->macos-core-tests(->reusable:macos-core-tests.yml:85m)->build(20m)->pipeline-status(5m)"
  note "The optional all-mode Agent CLI ladder retains schedule/manual execution and its historical cold-cycle observations above. Release-first deferral removes its pull-request reachability. The hosted check-ci-wall-clock on 8cbff5f8109a056dc916de3cdee9a5e9b4813103 discovers release.yml as the current 115-minute static maximum, below the unchanged 225-minute ceiling. This static timeout path does not certify observed timing, semantic success or production publication."
  requirement "R1085-16"
